# receipts/ is TRACKED where it is documentation (docs/jira wave receipts,
# crate fixture receipts). The old blanket **/receipts/ rule silently
# ignored docs/jira/**/receipts/*.md — wave close records vanished from
# status — so it is removed; runtime receipt noise is scoped below instead.
